# Temp directories created by local test runs (Windows %TEMP% / Unix /tmp)
# Example: C:\Users\<u>\AppData\Local\Temp\kandes-install-test-20260809-231930\
kandes-*-test-*/

# Note: on Windows + PowerShell, $tmp.FullName paths containing backslashes
# sometimes appear as untracked entries with mangled UTF-8 bytes (e.g.
# "C\357\200\272\357\201\234Users\..."). They live OUTSIDE the worktree
# (in %TEMP%), so they can never be committed/pushed. No ignore needed.
